<ttl id="1001A_S0009_7420K_T0012" variety="T0012">
<name>Height Control Sensor Sub-assembly Rear</name>
<para id="RM000001Y2K001X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="603K8-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000001Y2K001X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000001Y2K001X_01_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00009IM00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Height Control Sensor Sub-assembly Rear (Drive Type FF)</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Connect 3 dry cell batteries (1.5 V) in series.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Connect the battery positive (+) to terminal 3 (SHB) and the battery negative (-) to terminal 1 (SHG) of the connector, and apply 4.5 V between terminals 3 (SHB) - 1 (SHG).</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E146955J02" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Measure the voltage.</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), with voltage applied, measure the voltage between the terminals while slowly moving the link up and down.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" align="center" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Link Angle (Vehicle Height)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="2" valign="middle">
<ptxt>2(SHRR) - 1(SHG)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>+30° (High)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Approx. 3.45 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0° (Standard)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Approx. 2.25 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>-30° (Low)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Approx. 1.05 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
